  "description": "Remote Linq is a small and easy to use - yet very powerful - library to translate linq expression trees to strongly typed, serializable object trees and vice versa. It provides functionality to send arbitrary linq queries to a remote service to be applied and executed against any enumerable or queryable data source.",
